- `SOURCE_AND_COLLISION.md`, `source_access_01.json`–`source_access_07.json`:
  original-source adapters and actual access evidence, including failures.
- `PROOF_AND_DISPOSITION.md`: full author deductions and missing obligations.
  Its initial dependency-map reference to the D2LC value test as “Section 4”
  is a heading-pointer typo; the actual value audit is Section 3. The
  sidecar-consumed proof file is preserved unchanged.
- `pilot.py`, `runtime_wrapper.py`, `capture_pair.py`, `CANONICAL.json`,
  `execution_01/`, `execution_02/`: immutable original execution evidence.
- `d2lc_theorem/`: original-box intake, distinct implementation, two complete
